The transport handles receipts and snapshots independently, so the ordering is possible. The probe confirmed that the sheet closes after an admitted creation receipt, leaving the later draft undiscarded. The existing receipt-first test resolves the receipt and pushes the snapshot together, which misses this case. The onboarding and IPC secret-confinement test binaries passed independently; the retained hashes also match.
